 figure intentionally carries no title — much like many characters whose identities are partially stripped away through their portrayal within the male gaze.\n\nThis work primarily serves as a personal reflection and an in-depth exploration of fragmentation in the context of the male gaze. I myself am as affected as anyone else growing up in the system modern media provides, so it has been interesting trying to understands how much I myself am affected and without even knowing, striping people from their own identity through my own work.\n\nAt the same time, I hope that engaging with this piece can help reflect and create greater awareness and a deeper understanding of this kind of representation.\n\nI modeled with clay, build a form with plaster, pressed it out with clay and glazed it.","style":"text"}],"strokes":[],"ink":[],"m":{"top":0,"bottom":9181,"place":[{"ref":"2lhj36f2","x":70,"y":110,"w":194,"h":118},{"ref":"jbc3786u","x":72,"y":662,"w":936,"h":1404},{"ref":"cnhp8e6d","x":70,"y":326,"w":940,"h":158},{"ref":"034nlp0g","x":70,"y":480,"w":940,"h":116},{"ref":"udk9hppe","x":72,"y":2120,"w":937,"h":1404},{"ref":"an004cle","x":73,"y":3584,"w":935,"h":1404},{"ref":"cy8ko3nx","x":72,"y":5048,"w":936,"h":1404},{"ref":"s28g8r1m","x":72,"y":6512,"w":936,"h":1404},{"ref":"4f8xxy08","x":70,"y":7976,"w":940,"h":1102}],"own":[],"strokes":[],"ink":[],"hide":[],"skip":[]},"updated":"2026-11-19T18:16:30.987Z"}